\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Financial Services Manager Libby Bretthauer invited the community to participate in the City's online budget survey, available on the City website through March 31, 2025. The results will be shared at a future City Council meeting.\highlight1\line\line\highlight0 Planning Manager Adam Finestone invited the community to a forum to learn about the Residential Overlay District (ROD) at the Joslyn Community Center on April 9, 2025, from 6:00 PM - 8:00 PM.\cf2\b\i0\line\line\cf0\b0\i Library Manager Josh Murray announced that the Friends of the Library will be hosting their quarterly book sale on March 22, 2025, from 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM, and invited children to join a Fused Glass Treasure Boxes program, presented by Firework Studio, on March 29, 2025, from 3:00 PM to 4:00 PM.\line\line Waste Management Recycling Education Representative Bobby Bell announced that this past weekend marked International Global Recycling Earth Day. Manhattan Village hosted an event where WM had a table with games for kids and distributed home organic pails. He also invited the community to Grandview Elementary School\rquote s STEAM event, where WM will have a table on March 19, 2025. As a Chamber of Commerce member, he invited the community to the Young Executives Mixer at Shade Hotel on March 20, 2025, at 5:30 PM, and responded to City Council questions.\line\line\pard Police Chief Rachel Johnson invited the community to attend the upcoming Town Hall Meeting at the Joslyn Community Center on April 2, 2025, from 6:00 PM-8:00 PM.\cf3\i0\f1\par
